{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "articleId": "2bd8d6e81628",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-15T16:18:19Z",
  "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/optimizing-cost-and-latency-with-amazon-bedrock-prompt-caching/",
  "sourceTitle": "Optimizing cost and latency with Amazon Bedrock prompt caching",
  "sourceBodyHash": "278bac178f43aa15f44db149200b67d6e495b1141b6fa64ecaa823e3d1cc2167",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-03T12:54:24.741879Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T12:56:50.990936Z",
  "totalBlocks": 68,
  "translatedBlocks": 68,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f38358ca587e080d",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 的 Prompt 缓存功能在您反复向基础模型发送相同上下文时，可将输入 token 成本降低高达 90%，这一点基于 Amazon Bedrock Prompt 缓存定价。未使用缓存时，一份 10,000 token 的合同伴随 50 个用户问题发送，意味着需要按全价计费 500,000 个输入 token，而这些 token 对应的内容模型已经处理过。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5330d4516444e7d",
      "translationZh": "您可以通过缩短提示、减小上下文窗口或实施应用级缓存来缓解此问题。每种方案都涉及权衡：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "daab7a32c48f2dfb",
      "translationZh": "缩短的提示可以降低 token 数量，但也可能降低上下文质量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1d4f880dfd126518",
      "translationZh": "较小的上下文窗口会降低成本，但会以牺牲模型对完整信息进行推理的能力为代价。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c93346d5921d9b6",
      "translationZh": "响应缓存对相同查询处理得很好，但在相同上下文与不同问题配对时则无法提供任何好处。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35acf08f94edcff0",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock 的 Prompt 缓存功能在基础设施层面有助于缓解此挑战。当您缓存对话上下文的部分内容（系统提示、文档、工具定义）时，Amazon Bedrock 在后续请求中会直接读取缓存的 token，而不是重新处理它们。这可以降低首 token 延迟（TTFT），并且在缓存命中时将缓存输入 token 的成本降低高达 90%，而无需更改模型或提示质量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f9a39307b357a0f",
      "translationZh": "本文将使用 Amazon Bedrock 的 Converse API 演示六个实用的 Prompt 缓存场景，从基础到高级模式逐步递进：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05e7b431a6d72f35",
      "translationZh": "消息内容缓存：为多问题分析缓存长文档。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0d44405a8c19fdbe",
      "translationZh": "系统提示缓存：在对话之间缓存人设定义和指令。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b7ff2f655098983f",
      "translationZh": "工具定义缓存：为代理工作流缓存工具模式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "41aef202f38502b3",
      "translationZh": "混合TTL缓存：为不同内容层级分配不同的缓存生存时间。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e07ae107c7558e4",
      "translationZh": "租户隔离：在多租户应用中实现按租户的缓存分离。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "155190eed28afb4c",
      "translationZh": "LangChain集成：在LangChain框架中使用提示缓存。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7306d8a6c7691db7",
      "translationZh": "提示缓存的工作原理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09564d30b06cf846",
      "translationZh": "提示缓存存储部分处理输入的快照，使得具有相同前缀的后续请求可以跳过冗余计算。本节介绍请求流程、支持的模型和定价。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ce4136f41ed91af",
      "translationZh": "当您在请求中包含cachePoint标记时，Amazon Bedrock会评估该标记之前的内容是否与现有缓存条目匹配。如果匹配（缓存命中），模型可以跳过对这些标记的重新处理，并从缓存状态开始生成。如果不匹配（缓存未命中），模型会处理全部内容，并将结果写入缓存以供潜在的未来请求使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b573f0c756b5834",
      "translationZh": "此图显示了流程：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "893be09ff1c74bcb",
      "translationZh": "图 1：提示缓存请求流程，其中第一个请求写入缓存，第二个请求从缓存读取，从而降低 TTFT 和输入令牌成本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "067069582d480bce",
      "translationZh": "考虑到此流程，四个关键概念决定了缓存在实践中的行为：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e9e3048495e277f9",
      "translationZh": "缓存范围：缓存条目仅限于单个 AWS 账户和 AWS 区域。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e951f1c9c999450c",
      "translationZh": "令牌阈值：每个缓存检查点必须达到最小令牌阈值才能激活。例如，Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4.5 和 Sonnet 4.6 每个检查点至少需要 1,024 个令牌，而 Opus 模型至少需要 4,096 个令牌。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "743954460341b84e",
      "translationZh": "生存时间（TTL）：缓存条目根据请求中指定的 TTL 过期。默认为 5 分钟，某些模型支持最长 1 小时。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0a44214020476bde",
      "translationZh": "与模型无关的语法：Converse API 的 cachePoint 语法在所有受支持的模型系列中相同，包括 Anthropic Claude 和 Amazon Nova。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0bbd944c302b4c15",
      "translationZh": "有关最新模型支持信息，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock Prompt Caching 文档。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0b8f010dd8f8846",
      "translationZh": "提示缓存引入了除标准输入和输出标记之外的两种标记类别：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76caaf15e217c592",
      "translationZh": "写入缓存的标记（首次请求）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c859ab0086beec21",
      "translationZh": "比标准输入高 25%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92054e71ef736504",
      "translationZh": "从缓存读取的标记（后续请求）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6172389b0a255a64",
      "translationZh": "比标准输入低 90%",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c940c3628b753a99",
      "translationZh": "cacheWriteInputTokens（1 小时 TTL）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12734c0833a0e56e",
      "translationZh": "带 1 小时 TTL 的写入缓存的标记",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a638fcb1e4f8eb13",
      "translationZh": "比标准输入高 100%（2 倍）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7140b6fb528929d3",
      "translationZh": "对于具有重复上下文的工作负载，输入 token 成本的节省可达到大约 75%。例如，如果您发送一个包含 10,000 个 token 的文档以及 10 个不同的问题，第一个请求会产生 cache write cost。其余九个请求每次从缓存读取时成本降低 90%，从而使该文档上下文的输入 token 成本节省大约 75%。这假设所有后续请求都发生在 TTL window 内。过期后的请求会触发新的 cache write，降低净节省。有关详细定价信息，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 定价。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ef904a639562028",
      "translationZh": "在开始使用这些场景之前，请确保您具备以下条件：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "45c0d0535ace1a0e",
      "translationZh": "拥有在受支持的 AWS 区域（例如 us-west-2）中具有 Amazon Bedrock 访问权限的 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39e66478fb477871",
      "translationZh": "已为目标模型启用模型访问权限。本文示例使用 Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4.5（ global.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929-v1:0）。有关说明，请参阅 Manage model access。要了解最新模型和区域可用性，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 中的 Supported models by AWS Region。这是一个跨区域推理配置文件。请求会自动跨区域路由，这可能会偶尔增加 cache write frequency。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "931a5c0169cc16ae",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.10 或更高版本，并已安装以下依赖项：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a506625bca6ea01",
      "translationZh": "注意：Scenario 4（Mixed TTL）中使用的 cachePoint 的 ttl 参数需要 Boto3 1.43.0 或更高版本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f0a4719f95afd8d9",
      "translationZh": "通过默认配置文件或环境变量配置 AWS 凭据。有关设置说明，请参阅 Configure the AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c790e0dcc61bdd02",
      "translationZh": "Scenario 1：消息内容缓存",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4d06a1c56d715cd",
      "translationZh": "提示缓存的一个常见用例是缓存您反复查询的长文档或参考内容。例如，在检索增强生成（RAG）应用中，您会就同一文档提出多个问题，或者编码助手会引用大型代码库。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2cd0c3b778d7324",
      "translationZh": "在此场景中，您在静态文档和动态问题之间放置一个 cachePoint 标记。Amazon Bedrock 在首次调用时会缓存该文档，并在后续调用时可能重复使用它。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bc442c0f8092c313",
      "translationZh": "消息内容缓存的工作原理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64056ed088074671",
      "translationZh": "在静态内容之后、动态问题之前放置一个 cachePoint 内容块。Amazon Bedrock 会缓存检查点之前的所有内容，并在后续请求中重复使用：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d3afc302a0fdf30",
      "translationZh": "以下代码通过一个完整的工作示例将此模式付诸实践。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cde472f6bd9a60b",
      "translationZh": "首先，设置 Amazon Bedrock 运行时客户端并定义一个示例文档。在生产应用中，此文档可以是 PDF、知识库文章或其他超过 1,024 令牌阈值的内容：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a41aabec32cf773",
      "translationZh": "接下来，定义缓存函数。关键元素是放置在静态文档和动态问题之间的 cachePoint 块：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03d725f81957b781",
      "translationZh": "运行两个请求以观察缓存行为。初始调用会填充缓存，随后使用不同问题的调用会重复使用它：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fc4896bc325480ba",
      "translationZh": "读取缓存指标",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d1337f76c9c3b61",
      "translationZh": "响应使用对象包含两个与缓存相关的字段：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42d942a06c84073e",
      "translationZh": "写入缓存的令牌（首次请求时出现）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3456a7fb39c44adc",
      "translationZh": "从缓存读取的令牌（后续请求时出现）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ac84468ad52e64e",
      "translationZh": "在我们使用 Anthropic Claude Sonnet 4.5 且文档超过 1,024 个令牌的测试中，初始响应显示了缓存写入：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce402d68163c28b6",
      "translationZh": "使用相同文档前缀的后续请求会产生缓存读取：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6705b5b37d4e5a8",
      "translationZh": "请注意，cacheReadInputTokens 现在反映了从缓存读取的 1,898 个令牌。整个文档前缀在未重新处理的情况下被重复使用。只有 28 个令牌（即问题本身）被处理为标准输入。这些缓存令牌按降低的 cache-read 费率计费（比标准输入低 90%）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8664bb5e1a3efe96",
      "translationZh": "简化的缓存管理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "450344185ba0a9b9",
      "translationZh": "Claude 模型在 Amazon Bedrock 上支持简化的缓存管理。您可以放置一个单一的 cachePoint，Amazon Bedrock 会自动检查该标记之前大约 20 个内容块的前缀是否命中缓存。您不需要手动放置多个缓存检查点来获得对话早期部分的缓存命中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32f86fc073911fad",
      "translationZh": "为了更细粒度的控制，您可以在每个内容部分之后放置多个 cachePoint 标记：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3963fc7a0dd9de6b",
      "translationZh": "这种方法支持部分缓存命中。如果只有前两个部分与先前的请求匹配，模型将重用这些部分的缓存并处理剩余内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76819c2461471b09",
      "translationZh": "相同的缓存语法也适用于 converse_stream。关键区别是缓存指标会在流结束时的 metadata 事件中到达，而不是在即时响应中：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5b6e563d3815b62",
      "translationZh": "为了量化延迟改进，您可以测量有缓存和无缓存情况下的 TTFT：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bc91a52fc9eb107",
      "translationZh": "提示缓存可以降低 TTFT，随着缓存前缀大小的增加，收益会增加。对于较小的文档（大约 2,000–5,000 个 token），在少量迭代中改进可能不具统计显著性。确切的改进程度取决于文档大小、模型和当前负载。对于较大的缓存前缀（超过 10,000 个 token），TTFT 的降低会更加明显。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "175bfd6041ba1350",
      "translationZh": "场景 2：系统提示缓存",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a31a2afa71b07910",
      "translationZh": "许多应用使用详细的系统提示来定义模型的角色、指南和领域专业知识。这些系统提示可以跨越数千个 token，并在用户交互过程中保持不变。通过系统提示缓存，您只需一次性支付全部处理成本，然后在每条后续消息中重用缓存的系统提示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b344e8df3e68ffba",
      "translationZh": "缓存点位于系统参数内部，与用户消息分离。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d36b8a739c8c5fb",
      "translationZh": "Converse API 的系统参数接受内容块数组。在系统文本之后放置一个 cachePoint：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecacabf46af8948d",
      "translationZh": "下面的示例在完整请求中展示了这一点，包含详细的人设提示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdae6367f67bab27",
      "translationZh": "以下示例定义了一个全面的系统提示：具备详细响应指南的专家级空间科学顾问人设。该提示超过了缓存所需的 2,048-token 阈值：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
